 "description": "Search JobYap job postings by natural-language query. Matches job titles, falling back to significant keywords when the full phrase finds little. Returns result ids, titles and citable URLs for use with fetch. For structured filtering (location, company, remote, freshness) prefer search_jobs.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
